warning
# Issue #3119: a foreman Apply step refused one action — charter miss,
# bound reached, lint or guard refusal, failed effect. Warning, not
# error: a refusal is the safety surface doing its designed job (the
# action simply never took effect, and the reason is in the payload),
# but it is also the only signal that a foreman's plan is not landing,
# so it belongs in the warning stream the way
# outbound_body_secret_refused does.
